0,"text":"Donaldo rubs at his eye with a fist. \"Arrr, that was beautiful Captain. Makes me want to stab someone even more.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.288,"end":11.38,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":21},"large":{"start":0.288,"end":11.18,"frac":0.952,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"You shrug your shoulders and promise him he'll have plenty of opportunities to do so as you seal the deal with a handshake.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":12.384,"end":18.912,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"large":{"start":12.384,"end":18.912,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You’re basically out of time but there are librarians still hunting you, and Neckbeard's out there rounding up his own crew and gear.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":19.232,"end":25.72,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"large":{"start":19.232,"end":26.048,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":23,"words":23},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"Open your checklist. Do you think you have enough to set sail?","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":26.56,"end":29.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"large":{"start":26.56,"end":29.92,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":12,"words":12},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"Yes, head to The Sea Cat to get ready to depart. No more faffing about, the tide is almost upon you!","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":30.336,"end":37.824,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":21,"words":21},"large":{"start":30.336,"end":37.824,"frac":0.905,"status":"ok","matched":19,"words":21},"differ":false},{"i":5,"text":"Or","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":38.24,"end":38.72,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"large":{"start":38.24,"end":38.42,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":1,"words":1},"differ":false},{"i":6,"text":"No, you’re willing to cut it fine to get one final edge over Neckbeard in the weapons department. Look for one final pirate for your crew – one of the most bloodthirsty pirates you know.","isAppLine":true,"small":{"start":39.168,"end":51.072,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":34},"large":{"start":39.168,"end":51.072,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":34,"words":34},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68fbf48d68b54_JM9_Q1.jpg"}